{"overview":"پس از رها کردن مزرعه یلوستون، کیس داتن به یک واحد نخبه از مارشال‌های ایالات متحده می‌پیوندد و مهارت‌های خود را به عنوان یک کابوی و نیروی ویژه دریایی (Navy SEAL) ترکیب می‌کند تا عدالت را در مونتانا اجرا کند؛ جایی که او و هم‌تیمی‌هایش باید تعادلی بین خانواده، وظیفه و هزینه‌های روانی سنگین برقرار کنند...","tagline":"","overview_en":"With the Yellowstone Ranch behind him, Kayce Dutton joins an elite unit of U.S. Marshals, combining his skills as a cowboy and Navy SEAL to bring range justice to Montana, where he and his teammates must balance family, duty and the high psychological cost that comes with serving as the last line of defense in the region's war on violence.","tagline_en":"A new era of Yellowstone.","runtime":null,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":13,"y":2026,"poster":"/nInfaveN1iFpRIcMGNKENoVVUT2.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":3,"y":2026,"poster":"/wJUJ6vTSq7qUSXkht2NcwnxVm8x.jpg"}],"episodes":16,"crew":["Spencer Hudnut"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"لوک گریمز","role":"Kayce Dutton","photo":"/c547Xiwf9feeDbGfQchfJCkC111.jpg","en":"Luke Grimes"},{"name":"لوگان مارشال-گرین","role":"Pete Calvin","photo":"/vOV76X3Dd8LsBxrTLdHybFLU8w8.jpg","en":"Logan Marshall-Green"},{"name":"آریل کبل","role":"Belle Skinner","photo":"/c98cwlydVsihduXnq6VLW4fQFC.jpg","en":"Arielle Kebbel"},{"name":"Ash Santos","role":"Andrea Cruz","photo":"/uT0GGLGN2mAZcc0dlVrtP7cpy6t.jpg"},{"name":"Tatanka Means","role":"Miles Kittle","photo":"/Aq7VrwQeUeDNn0y74m7bxDBOAGj.jpg"},{"name":"Brecken Merrill","role":"Tate Dutton","photo":"/j2cJIrlfMSVWCq491ZMnguhGjXP.jpg"},{"name":"Mo Brings Plenty","role":"Mo","photo":"/2CxofuWPRZf3G0kYJytblYiHXIy.jpg"},{"name":"گیل بیرمنگام","role":"Thomas Rainwater","photo":"/bWYOwtq0zUgpbEhTyiJHo2TmVju.jpg","en":"Gil Birmingham"}],"trailer":"FGKuQa6ulEQ","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/290856-marshals/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"fuboTV","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/3wF8xISfVlcrc8